{"qid": "con_00011", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 18628.13, "n_tokens": 128, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.9047619047619048, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 220, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=0.90 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》的相关规定，以下情形可以认定为共同债务：\n\n1. **夫妻双方共同签名或者夫妻一方事后追认等共同意思表示所负的债务**：包括工资、奖金、劳务报酬、生产、经营、投资的收益、知识产权的收益、继承或者受赠的财产，但本法第一千零六十三条第三项规定的除外；\n\n2. **夫妻一方在婚姻关系存续期间以个人名义为家庭日常生活需要所负的债务**，但债权人能够证明该债务用于夫妻共同生活、共同生产经营或者基于夫妻双方共同意思表示的", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.049, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1064", "score": 0.6583, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1064, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1062", "score": 0.1996, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1062, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）鲁01民终2054号_1", "score": 0.0658, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）鲁01民终2054号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）鲁01民再2266号_1", "score": 0.0658, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）鲁01民再2266号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）鲁01民再1231号_1", "score": 0.0658, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）鲁01民再1231号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）鲁01民初1458号_1", "score": 0.0658, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）鲁01民初1458号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）川01民再1230号_1", "score": 0.0658, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）川01民再1230号"}, {"doc_id": "jd